00:06.480 --> 00:08.220
to actually see them in a file

00:08.220 --> 00:10.710
uh instead of having to see them in your terminal.

00:10.710 --> 00:12.540
A lot of the time this is really useful,

00:12.540 --> 00:15.180
especially if you're working on large projects

00:15.180 --> 00:16.200
with tons of files,

00:16.200 --> 00:19.020
And this is one of the areas I think GUIs shine

00:19.020 --> 00:21.060
when you're working with Git.

00:21.060 --> 00:22.830
So, here's Git Kraken.

